head of you with all the advanced features you require to improve your salon business operations, employee productivity and financial management. The support is excellent and its the best priced salon software in the market. Thanks, Fresha!</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><p class="text-[17px] font-medium leading-[24px]">Carien S</p><p class="truncate text-[15px] leading-[20px] text-neutral-fadedForeground">Salon General Manager</p></div><div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(24px)"><div class="shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden" style="width:300px"><div class="flex h-[480px] flex-col items-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted p-8 text-muted-foreground"><span class="flex h-5 gap-2"><div class="size-5 tablet:size-5"><svg id="img" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="m29.3 13.299-5.633 4.92 1.687 7.326a2 2 0 0 1-1.86 2.453 2 2 0 0 1-1.118-.285l-6.384-3.876-6.37 3.876a1.997 1.997 0 0 1-2.979-2.168l1.685-7.318-5.635-4.928A2 2 0 0 1 3.831 9.79l7.428-.644 2.9-6.92a1.994 1.994 0 0 1 2.943-.892c.327.218.582.528.734.891l2.908 6.921 7.425.644a1.998 1.998 0 0 1 1.757 2.531 2 2 0 0 1-.62.977z"></path></svg></div><div class="size-5 tablet:size-5"><svg id="img" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="m29.3 13.299-5.633 4.92 1.687 7.326a2 2 0 0 1-1.86 2.453 2 2 0 0 1-1.118-.285l-6.384-3.876-6.37 3.876a1.997 1.997 0 0 1-2.979-2.168l1.685-7.318-5.635-4.928A2 2 0 0 1 3.831 9.79l7.428-.644 2.9-6.92a1.994 1.994 0 0 1 2.943-.892c.327.218.582.528.734.891l2.908 6.921 7.425.644a1.998 1.998 0 0 1 1.757 2.531 2 2 0 0 1-.62.977z"></path></svg></div><div class="size-5 tablet:size-5"><svg id="img" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="m29.3 13.299-5.633 4.92 1.687 7.326a2 2 0 0 1-1.86 2.453 2 2 0 0 1-1.118-.285l-6.384-3.876-6.37 3.8